        "original_id": "45f7fad4-b421-57a7-8117-9d64b98719b7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: DARPA Grand Challenge (2007)\n- Places: George Air Force Base, Southern California Logistics Airport, Victorville, California, Los Angeles, California, West of the United States\n\nFacts:\n- The DARPA Grand Challenge (2007) took place on November 3, 2007.\n- The DARPA Grand Challenge (2007) was held at the site of the now-closed George Air Force Base.\n- The site of George Air Force Base is currently used as Southern California Logistics Airport.\n- The DARPA Grand Challenge (2007) took place in Victorville, California, in the western United States.\n- George Air Force Base is a former United States Air Force base.\n- George Air Force Base is within the city limits of Victorville, California, about 8 miles northwest of central Victorville.\n- George Air Force Base is about 75 miles northeast of Los Angeles, California.",
